    "title": "For Annie Bond, Research Is More Than Hope-It's a Lifeline - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Meredith Begley ,\n2 days ago\nEleven years after a stage 4, metastatic breast cancer diagnosis, Annie dedicates her time to advocating for research. As a comedian, finding the humor in life came naturally to Annie Bond—even during life-altering health news. At just 26 years old, she received a metastatic breast cancer diagnosis, in between working a double shift as a waitress.\nRead full article",
